#: ../../entities/government-jinshan.rst:1
msgid "Jinshan science and technology authority"
msgstr "金山区科技主管部门"

#: ../../entities/government-jinshan.rst:4
msgid "金山区科技主管部门"
msgstr "金山区科技主管部门"

#: ../../entities/government-jinshan.rst:6
msgid "Government | Jinshan | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "政府部门｜金山区｜资料核查日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/government-jinshan.rst:8
msgid ""
"The 2025-2026 park plan names Jinshan New Materials Incubator, East China "
"UAV Base and Bay Area incubation carriers. It connects testing and "
"industrialization, subject to park admission and the applicable aviation "
"permissions."
msgstr "2025至2026年园区方案列出金山新材料孵化器、华东无人机基地与湾区孵化载体，衔接检测及产业化；须分别办理园区准入与适用的航空许可。"

#: ../../entities/government-jinshan.rst:10
msgid ""
"`Evidence S023 "
"<https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/gwk/search/content/7eeec00799b34f9b9288a57ce0a4ef85>`_. "
"金山区人民政府关于印发《张江高新区金山园改革创新发展行动方案(2025-2026年)》的通知."
msgstr "`资料来源 S023 <https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/gwk/search/content/7eeec00799b34f9b9288a57ce0a4ef85>`_. 金山区人民政府关于印发《张江高新区金山园改革创新发展行动方案(2025-2026年)》的通知."

#: ../../entities/government-jinshan.rst:12
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "项目状态与支持内容"

#: ../../entities/government-jinshan.rst:15
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认"

#: ../../entities/government-jinshan.rst:17
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "尚未确认统一的现金资助额度、费用减免或股权比例，请向运营机构索取最新书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/government-jinshan.rst:19
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系方式与地址"

#: ../../entities/government-jinshan.rst:22
msgid "`Official website / intake route <https://www.jinshan.gov.cn/>`_"
msgstr "`官网及申请渠道 <https://www.jinshan.gov.cn/>`_"

#: ../../entities/government-jinshan.rst:24
msgid ""
"Use the official website to request the responsible team and current "
"application route. Email addresses are not reproduced in this publication."
msgstr "请通过官网咨询具体负责部门及最新申请方式。本图谱不公开电子邮箱地址。"

#: ../../entities/government-jinshan.rst:26
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图采用行政区或校区参考点，不代表已核实的办公地址。"

#: ../../entities/government-jinshan.rst:28
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/government-jinshan.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "以下步骤为本书整理的申请参考，实际办理流程以最新官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/government-jinshan.rst:33
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读有明确发布日期的通知，确认属地、申请主体、业务及费用发生期间等条件。"

#: ../../entities/government-jinshan.rst:35
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "按清单准备材料，并按要求取得依托单位或区级部门推荐。"

#: ../../entities/government-jinshan.rst:37
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止时间前通过官方平台提交，保存受理回执。"

#: ../../entities/government-jinshan.rst:39
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "按通知要求完成评审、立项、报告、验收及资金拨付手续。"

#: ../../entities/government-jinshan.rst:41
msgid ":doc:`Jinshan district route </districts/jinshan>`"
msgstr ":doc:`金山区合作指南 </districts/jinshan>`"

